# 1. High-Level Test Scenarios – WhatsApp “Send Message”

I selected the **Send Message** feature because it is a simple and commonly used feature.

1. **Send a message to a single contact** – Verify that a text message is successfully sent and delivered to the selected person.
2. **Send a message to a group** – Check that the message reaches all members of the group.
3. **Send an empty message** – Verify that the app does not allow a blank message to be sent.
4. **Send a long message** – Check whether the app handles a message containing a large number of characters properly.
5. **Send a message with poor/no internet connection** – Verify that the message shows an appropriate pending or failed status instead of disappearing.

